## Stock price vs revenue dashboard

this project shows historical stock prices and company revenue data of tesla and gamestop using python
it showcases data collection cleaning and visualization through dashboards using python.


## Overview :

extract historical stock price
scrape company revenue data
clean and process datasets
visualize stock price vs revenue trends


## Tools:
-python
-pandas
-matplotlib


## Attribution :
- Originally based on a guided Coursera project (IBM Python Project for Data Science), then refined and customized for portfolio demonstration.
